  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Yes and when: the wenn rule",
   "texto": [
    "**Wenn** means «Yeah.» (condition) and «when» (present or future moment): **Wenn es regnet, bleibe ich zu Hause** (if it rains, I stay at home).",
    "The verb of the sentence with «wenn» goes to the end (**regnet**) and the following sentence begins directly by its verb: **bleibe ich...**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Although: obwohl",
   "texto": [
    "**Obwohl** introduces a difficulty or contrast: **Obwohl ich müde bin, gehe ich zur Arbeit** (although I am tired, I will work). The verb also goes to the end: **bin**."
   ]
